<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-3/8 (FIM 204.80).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $45-3/8 (FIM 204.80).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $0-3/8 at $45-3/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 204.80 markka. In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia A closed unchanged at 207.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $1-1/4 at $30-1/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 68.27 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.80 markka at 70.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed unchanged at $18 on Wednesday. The price equals about 81.24 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma closed unchanged at 83.00 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
